  "title": "United Bank Celebrates 187 Years of Service",
  "summary": "United Bank’s story began on March 17, 1839. Over the past 187 years, it has grown into a premier banking institution with a strong presence across the Mid-Atlantic and Southeast. To celebrate the Bank’s anniversary, United will continue its long-standing tradition of celebrating with customers at local branches on St. Patrick’s Day, a holiday the Bank enjoys sharing.",
